 b6 Backend origin — no trailing slash.
#
# LOCAL DEV: Leave VITE_API_URL empty.
#   The Vite dev server proxy forwards /api/* → http://localhost:4000 automatically.
#
# PRODUCTION (Vercel): Set this to your deployed Render backend URL, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://fandomloop-india-api.onrender.com
#
# How to set it on Vercel:
#   Vercel dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Name: VITE_API_URL   Value: https://your-api.onrender.com
#   Applies to: Production (and Preview if desired)
#
# After changing this value you must redeploy for it to take effect.
VITE_API_URL=
